#
# If the graphics allocator dies and restarts, the processes using it that
# are not restarted stay bound to the dead binder: every allocation fails
# with EX_TRANSACTION_FAILED (-129) until they restart too. Its .rc only
# restarts surfaceflinger; here the codec and camera services are restarted
# (§58.8: recording stuck after an allocator crash).
on property:init.svc.vendor.graphics.allocator.minigbm_upstream=restarting
    restart android-hardware-media-c2-v4l2-hal
    restart vendor.camera.provider-libcamera
